cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Naulon: field-level model of the cellular data envelope of a vehicle telematics fleet"
message: "If you use this software or its model data, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Edet
    given-names: Sebastien
repository-code: "https://github.com/SebE585/naulon"
abstract: >-
  Naulon models the monthly cellular data envelope of a vehicle telematics
  fleet field by field, billing each field at the rate of the clock it
  actually follows, then adding record framing, transport overhead and
  per-session billing rounding. It separates acquisition rate, output rate and
  transmission rate, which vendor pricing tiers routinely conflate. Outputs are
  in megabytes and sessions; tariffs are supplied by the user, never shipped.
keywords:
  - telematics
  - fleet management
  - GNSS
  - cellular data
  - M2M
  - data budget
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
